			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Rebrand configuration to FIDDEE and regenerate upstream service contracts\n\nUpdate the product branding constants in ResolveConfiguration.ts to replace \"Land\" with \"FIDDEE\" across application names, data folders, and URL protocols. Align telemetry fallback events to the new \"fiddee\" app identifier. Simultaneously regenerate all Codegen artifacts to reflect upstream VS Code source changes, including the removal of IChatToolOutputStateCache in favor of IChatOutputPartStateCache, addition of IAgentHostOTelService and IOTelSqliteStore, and updates to IChatEntitlementService for BYOK model support. Correct codegen output formatting to use standard tabs instead of escape sequences for generated interface definitions.",
